pipeline.prompt:
Changes were requested on PR #{{feature.pr}}.
Open findings (source of truth, from the conductor database):
{{findings.open}}

Human feedback from the merge gate (empty unless a human rejected there):
{{steps.merge.output}}

Apply fixes in {{feature.worktree}}, commit and push.
For EVERY finding listed above, report a resolution. Call conductor_report with outcome=succeeded and notes as JSON:
{"resolutions": [{"id": "F1", "status": "fixed", "note": "<what you changed>"}, {"id": "F2", "status": "dismissed", "note": "<why no change is needed>"}], "summary": "<one paragraph>"}
Statuses: fixed = you changed code/tests; dismissed = no change needed (justify!). blocker/major MUST be fixed, never dismissed without an exceptional reason. Do NOT reply to or resolve PR threads yourself — the conductor projects your resolutions onto GitHub.
